  "label": "User projected onto the man in the foreground as the subject of the procedural request",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the foreground (man_in_foreground) because the textual material ('state your name for the record') is directly addressed to him, implying he is the one required to perform the action. The user identifies with the role of the person being asked to comply with the formal procedure, creating a direct projection onto this visual entity.",
